{
  "info": {
    "name": "13 - User Profile Management API",
    "description": "Complete user profile management with authentication, avatar upload, session management, API keys, security logs, and 2FA/TOTP.\n\n**Phase 3: User Management APIs (17 Endpoints)**\n\n**Features:**\n- Profile CRUD operations\n- Avatar upload with image processing\n- Multi-device session management\n- API key generation and management\n- Security audit trail\n- 2FA/TOTP with backup codes\n\n**Authentication:** All endpoints require Clerk JWT token\n\n**Base URL:** {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{clerkToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Profile Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Profile",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status code is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has user data', function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('email');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('clerkId');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Save user ID for other requests",
                  "const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', jsonData.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profile",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "profile"]
            },
            "description": "Get current user's profile information including personal details, preferences, and account statistics."
          },
          "response": []
